      "writtenOn": "2021-06-03T05:54:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "hmm... assuming ls_en is active high rst active low:\n\ndoes this chip have a timing parameter from power-stable\nto reset release?\n\nthe comment on CONFIG_KB800X_POWER_ON_DELAY_MS indicates that\nthe following delay should be between these two GPIO enables.",
